  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The areas identified as electric vehicle parking and charging shall be retained as such for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "&lt;p&gt;The tree protection measures on site shall be carried out in accordance with those illustrated by drawing number&amp;nbsp;10376-0702_05 Rev A - Tree Protection Plan, dated 17th October 2024.&amp;nbsp; The works shall comply with BS 3998:2010 (Tree Work - Recommendations) and, where required, shall be supervised by a suitably qualified arboriculturist and any post-construction mitigation measures shall thereafter be maintained for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawing numbers 001_10 Rev B dated 17th April 2023, 001_29 Rev C dated 19 March 2024, 001_53 Rev B dated 15 August 2024 and 10376 - 0702_01-PL Rev A dated 2nd October 2024.</p>",
    "The materials to be used for the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those illustrated by supporting document&nbsp;EVD160KU/C01 Parameters of the manual V3.0 and shall thereafter be retained as such for the lifetime of the development."
  ],
